561 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 222 0 R
/T (AC: A register BR: B register Left most bit in AC and BR represent the sign of the numbers Two sign bits are added or subtracted together with the other bits in the complementer and parallel adder Overflow flip-flop V is set to 1 if there is an overflow, output carry is discarded in this case In the addition of two unsigned number an overflow is detected from the end carry. In case of signed number sign bit is treated as part of number and so end carry does not indicate overflow)
/E (AC: A register BR: B register Left most bit in AC and BR represent the sign of the numbers Two sign bits are added or subtracted together with the other bits in the complementer and parallel adder Overflow flip-flop V is set to 1 if there is an overflow, output carry is discarded in this case In the addition of two unsigned number an overflow is detected from the end carry. In case of signed number sign bit is treated as part of number and so end carry does not indicate overflow)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
endobj
