590 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 223 0 R
/T (Hardware implementation for sign magnitude data Adder for adding the partial products and store the result of multiplication in a register Instead of shifting multiplicand towards left, partial product can be shifted towards right  Store multiplier in Q register and sign of multiplier in Qs Store multiplicand in B register and sign of multiplier in Bs SC = number of bits in multiplier initially, decrement by 1 after forming each partial product, process stops when SC is 0)
/E (Hardware implementation for sign magnitude data Adder for adding the partial products and store the result of multiplication in a register Instead of shifting multiplicand towards left, partial product can be shifted towards right  Store multiplier in Q register and sign of multiplier in Qs Store multiplicand in B register and sign of multiplier in Bs SC = number of bits in multiplier initially, decrement by 1 after forming each partial product, process stops when SC is 0)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
